<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-No Australia bank probe report in week - source.</title>
<headline>RTRS-No Australia bank probe report in week - source.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian government would not release the recommendations of its inquiry into the financial system this week, a government source said on Monday.</p>
<p>However, a spokesman for Treasurer Peter Costello said Costello had not yet determined a date for the release of the report.</p>
<p>Shares in Westpac Banking Corp and Australia and New Zealand Banking Group Ltd jumped last week on speculation that the release of the Wallis inquiry report was imminent.</p>
</text>
